MODULE 1 — STT1024_A4_State.tla

```tla
-------------------------- MODULE STT1024_A4_State --------------------------
EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences

CONSTANTS
    M,              \* FSM mode set (finite)
    Tiles,          \* Tile identifier set (finite)
    Tasks,          \* Task identifier set (finite)
    Sensors,        \* Sensor set (finite)
    SensorDomain,   \* Sensor → finite domain
    W,              \* SRAM window size (Nat)
    MaxCycle        \* Cycle counter upper bound (Nat)

ASSUME FiniteM       == IsFiniteSet(M)
ASSUME FiniteTiles   == IsFiniteSet(Tiles)
ASSUME FiniteTasks   == IsFiniteSet(Tasks)
ASSUME FiniteSensors == IsFiniteSet(Sensors)
ASSUME DomainFinite  == \A s \in Sensors : IsFiniteSet(SensorDomain[s])
ASSUME WPos          == W \in Nat /\ W > 0
ASSUME MaxCyclePos   == MaxCycle \in Nat /\ MaxCycle > 0

\* State schema (A4 §2.1).
WorldReading == [s \in Sensors |-> SensorDomain[s]]

State == [
    mode  : M,
    ctx   : Tiles \X Tasks,
    world : WorldReading,
    mem   : Seq(BOOLEAN),                \* bounded SRAM window
    meta  : [cycle : 0..MaxCycle, task : Tasks]
]

\* SRAM window invariant: length is exactly W.
MemInvariant(s) == Len(s.mem) = W

\* Valid state predicate.
ValidState(s) ==
    /\ s.mode \in M
    /\ s.ctx[1] \in Tiles
    /\ s.ctx[2] \in Tasks
    /\ \A sen \in Sensors : s.world[sen] \in SensorDomain[sen]
    /\ MemInvariant(s)
    /\ s.meta.cycle \in 0..MaxCycle
    /\ s.meta.task \in Tasks

\* Σ — input alphabet (A4 §4.1). Quantized sensor reading.
Sigma == WorldReading

\* Finiteness of S — the load-bearing property.
FinitenessOfState ==
    \* |S| < ∞ follows from finite components.
    /\ IsFiniteSet(WorldReading)
    /\ IsFiniteSet([Tiles \X Tasks])
    /\ W \in Nat

=============================================================================
```

